### Inventory management
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Low-stock report: active products at or below their reorder level
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/low-stock

### Restock +20  -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": 20, "reason": "Supplier delivery" }

### Remove stock (damaged goods)  -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": -2, "reason": "Damaged in storage" }

### Remove more than exists  -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": -100000, "reason": "Typo" }

### Zero change  -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "change": 0, "reason": "Nothing" }

### Stock history for a product (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock-movements
